=== decode rejects types that JSON cannot represent
import json
let b: Result<[fn() -> int]> = json.decode("[]")
struct Hooks { on: [str: fn() -> int] }
struct App { hooks: Hooks? }
let a: Result<App> = json.decode("{}")
--- error
2: [fn() -> int] does not implement `Decode` because the elements of `[fn() -> int]` have type `fn() -> int`
5: App does not implement `Decode` because field `on` of `Hooks` has type `[str: fn() -> int]`

